			<a class="hover:text-blue" href="mailto:ethoma@mail.ubc.ca">email</a>
			<a class="hover:text-blue" href="https://github.com/ethanthoma">github</a>
			<a class="hover:text-blue" href="https://x.com/EthanBThoma">x</a>
			<a class="hover:text-blue" href="https://github.com/ethanthoma/personal-website">source</a>
